{
 "id": 530209,
 "titulo": "2.5 Update Details",
 "fecha": 1474271040192,
 "modificada": 1732665725087,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/530209",
 "html": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">It is finally time to unveil Marvel Future Fight 2.5 details! New characters, new uniforms and an all new mode make up this update. Are you ready for Shadowland? Check out the details below and let us know what you think of the changes that 2.5 will bring. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">2 New Characters</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;The master of Kung Fu, &ldquo;Shang-Chi&rdquo; and the bionic armed &ldquo;Misty Knight&rdquo; join the Fight!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/09/191659/Resized_01-2.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp;* Shang-Chi and Misty Knight are available through the Hero Chest!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;New Team Bonuses and Achievements have been added for both characters.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">4 New Uniforms</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">We are bringing you 4 brand new uniforms to help boost your characters. The New Uniforms for Ghost Rider, Black Cat, Daredevil and Moon Knight have been added. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2016/09/191450/Resized_02.jpg\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #c00000;\">* New Uniforms will be on sale during the sales period.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #c00000;\"><br /> <strong>* You will be available to check more details and changes in Marvel Universe and Uniform room.</strong></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">New Mode: Shadowland</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;Get ready for the next battle! Shadowland has been added, and is a challenge against many characters that you once called your allies. Prepare yourselves for the toughest of challenges. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2016/09/191450/Resized_03.jpg\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;Every floor of Shadowland will be one of 2 different types of stages: </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;<strong>- Fixed Stage:</strong> The challenge is set for you, and you will need to overcome this challenge in order to advance. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2016/09/191450/Resized_04.jpg\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;- &#83;electable Stage:</strong> You will be able to choose one of three stages for you to complete in order to move to the next floor. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; color: #ff0000;\">&nbsp;Rewards Shown may vary in live build</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2016/09/191450/Resized_05.jpg\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;You may pick up to 3 characters to enter the fight.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/09/191452/Resized_06-2.jpg\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp;* You will not be allowed to use a character again in the Shadowland until the timer resets. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;You will have to defeat all the foes in the time limit provided in order to move to the next level of the Shadowlands.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2016/09/191450/Resized_07.jpg\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">3 New 6<span lang=\"KO\">★</span> Skills</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp; Giant-Man, Yellowjacket, and Black Cat will get their 6<span lang=\"KO\">★</span> Skills.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2016/09/191450/Resized_08.jpg\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">6 New Tier-2 Advancements</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Giant-Man, Yellowjacket, Black Cat, Daredevil, Shang-Chi, and Misty Knight are able to advance their powers and become Tier-2 Characters! Check out the following Characters who will be able to advance in 2.5.0.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 7.5pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/09/191654/Resized_09-2.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #0070c0;\">[Advancement?]</span></strong><br /> &nbsp; &nbsp;A character which is Advanced from Tier-1 to Tier-2 will gain a stat increase, as well as a new passive skill.<br /> <span style=\"color: #c00000;\">&nbsp; * Level, Mastery, and Gear Upgrade will not change after the Advancement.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">New Feature: Lock System</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;1. Lock System for Comic Cards, Special Gears, and ISO-8</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp; - You will be able to &#115;elect items that will be locked, and therefore will be unable to be sold/upgraded. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; You will need to unlock to sell and/or use</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #c00000;\">&nbsp; * To unlock an item, go to the locked item and unlock it. </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2016/09/191450/Resized_10.jpg\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">New Feature: Comic Card Auto Upgrade</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;1. Upgrade All</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp; The Upgrade All &#98;utton has been added! This &#98;utton will make upgrading cards much quicker and easier. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;Except for cards which are locked, Upgrade All will use all cards in a &#115;elected rank to be upgraded to the next level!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp; - You will not be able to choose which cards will be upgraded! Please note that the process is not reversible. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp; - If you don&rsquo;t have enough material and/or gold, you will not be able to use the Upgrade All &#98;utton. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 13.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp; - Upgrade All &#98;utton will not use cards that are locked.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2016/09/191450/Resized_11.jpg\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;2. Quick Upgrade</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp; - A new Quick Upgrade has been added. This is a way to quickly upgrade one &#115;elected card. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp; - You will not able to &#115;elect which cards to use for the upgrade in Quick Upgrade, however it will use your lowest quality cards first. . </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp; * Quick Upgrade requires enough materials and/or gold to proceed</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/09/191452/Resized_12.jpg\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">New Feature: Character Details</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>1. Additional Stats</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">More stats have been added to the details window. The previously not shown stats; Defense Penetration, Ignore Dodge Elemental Damages, Crowd Control, and Skill Cooldown will all now be displayed. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Those stats that are not shown in Details window; Defense Penetration, Ignore Dodge, Elemental Damages, Crowd Control, and Skill Cooldown Time, are now be able to check in the Details Window</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>2. Specific Status Tab</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">In the Details window, you will be able to check the amount of stats gained from Gears, ISO-8, and Cards</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/09/191452/Resized_13.jpg\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp; <strong>- All:</strong> Overall stats are shown in this tab</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp; - Gear:</strong> Boosted stats based on Gears are shown in this tab</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp; - ISO-8:</strong> Boosted stats based on ISO-8 and ISO-8 Set Effects are shown in this tab</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp; - Card:</strong> Boosted stats based on Comic Cards are shown in this tab</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">Alliance Tournament Changes</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;1. Replay</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp; You will be able to view replays of matches that have already been finished</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/09/191452/Resized_14.jpg\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;2. Cheering Buffs</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">To level the playing fields, Cheer Buffs have been removed! </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Instead, the rewards from cheering will change depending on how many people cheer for a specific alliance. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;3. Schedule changes in 3<sup>rd</sup> Place Match and Finals</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp; 3<sup>rd</sup> Place Match and Finals will be held on the same day</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;4. Cheering Bonus Reward Changes</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Cheering Bonus Reward will be changed based on &#115;elected Alliance&rsquo;s Rank and Cheer ratio.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;5. Time limit until the end of match for current Alliance Tournament will be shown</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">Other Changes</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">1. Show a message for Tier-2 Base Characters that they are not able to use Rank Up/Mastery Ticket</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">2. Fixed an issue with World Boss Mission where non 6 Starred characters could be entered</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">3. Fixed an issue with Thanos that where he uses a normal attack instead his skill</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Following skills have been added for Thanos&rsquo; Striker Skill: Titan Beam, Cosmic Shift, Cosmic Drop</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">4. Fixed an issue where attendance event icons do not show properly in certain situations</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">5. Fixed an issue with Item Shop that cannot be &#114;efreshed</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">6. Fixed an issue with Alliance Tournament Matches where sometimes a p&#108;ayer would lose a match once the time limit ends</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">7. Fixed an issue where Dimension Rift Completion Bar could display incorrectly </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">8. Fixed an issue with Special Mission &ndash; Baked Alaska where Characters could get stuck at certain points</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">9. Fixed an issue with Co-Op with Friend&rsquo;s Characters in View-Mode where the In-Game Tool Tip does not disappear</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">10. You can only &#115;elect characters that you own for your in-game avatar</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">11. Fixed an issue with Captain Marvel where she cannot attack enemies in Alliance Tournament under certain situations</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">12. Fixed an issue with Captain Marvel when she use Radiant Form that the Form suddenly ends in Battleworld</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">13. Recommended Hero List in Villain Siege has been updated to include new characters. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">14. Tagging (Also Known as Switching) cool down times will now be shown on a characters portrait &nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">15. Faction Battles will now display information regarding the faction battle, and why the two characters are opposed to each other. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">16. Skill De&#115;criptions can be scrolled up and down in Skill Level Up Window.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">17. Fixed an issue with Captain America(Sharon Rogers)&rsquo;s skill Sky Dragoon missing its first hit</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">18. Fixed an issue with Captain America(Sharon Rogers)&rsquo;s skill Freedom Strike where is misses its last hit</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><img id=\"d8UP4x7Uzuk\" class=\"youtube_thumb\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/d8UP4x7Uzuk/sddefault.jpg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" /></p>"
}